{"synopsis":"“Aku hidup seperti anjing dengan kalung. Tapi di kehidupan ini, aku akan hidup sebagai anjing gila.”\n\nDemi raja yang diliputi kegilaan, aku menghunus pedang. Dan pada akhirnya mati di tangan sahabatku sendiri.\nLalu ketika membuka mata.. Aku terlahir kembali sebagai cucu bungsu sahabatku?\n\nMulai sekarang, aku tidak akan pernah lagi menjadi anjing yang setia.\nKalung, kesetiaan, takdir!\n\nSemuanya akan kucampakkan, dan aku akan hidup sesukaku.\nDosa dari kehidupan lalu sudah lunas. Di kehidupan ini, saatnya aku membuat onar sesuka hati.","alternative_title":"공작가에는 미친개가 산다","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"68","chapter":"68","slug":"895c82ab-0be8-46b7-b680-d3612b536636","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"number":"67","chapter":"67","slug":"db3abf2d-adbe-4f8c-bec9-88080df463e4","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"number":"66","chapter":"66","slug":"7c0b6309-1055-448e-8714-4bd36a8f1eb3","date":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"number":"65","chapter":"65","slug":"6a4e13d5-867e-49b7-8c3b-bba8c9a4afc5","date":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"eae439cd-8ee0-48b9-aa55-48352ba206e2","date":"2026-06-27","images":[]},{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"17356d67-ab13-4849-a1bd-11e054e0164b","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"3dfd4f3d-1176-419b-8657-baf00c9a029e","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"6e41cda6-b582-49f9-9d21-4bc8de3a0330","date":"2026-06-06","images":[]},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"de4e1fc3-33ce-4ecd-b04d-d74ca69dbb9e","date":"2026-05-30","images":[]},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"dca69201-3e8d-4bba-9401-273ff5b7353c","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"4b1326ea-2f94-426a-9a22-bbc47d699b00","date":"2026-05-15","images":[]},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"7233b771-22bd-42d4-aa4d-6414165585ad","date":"2026-05-09","images":[]},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"c9f10